5
00:00:11,521 --> 00:00:13,882
And that starts with controlling how

6
00:00:13,995 --> 00:00:17,128
messages are processed by Pi. Let's say

7
00:00:17,288 --> 00:00:19,266
you're in a session, a new one or an

