35
00:01:23,047 --> 00:01:23,239
this.

36
00:01:23,977 --> 00:01:26,077
That is what steering means. It will be

37
00:01:26,077 --> 00:01:29,234
injected into the current conversation once

38
00:01:29,507 --> 00:01:31,206
the agent is ready for it. So it will not

39
00:01:31,206 --> 00:01:33,979
