course, as part of that task, it will also

74
00:02:47,465 --> 00:02:49,887
output a final message. But right after

75
00:02:49,952 --> 00:02:52,518
that, this message will become active and

76
00:02:52,535 --> 00:02:54,973
will start a new conversation, so to say.

77
00:02:55,502 --> 00:02:57,570
And what you wanna use simply depends on

78
00:02:57,570 --> 00:02:58,949
